# Play test of Bramblewood Isle (CIPlay bramblewood_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the jetty, the woodcutter's
# cabin and box, the bear's den and its chest, the boars, the treasure. Points as in its recipe.
island Bramblewood Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Bear 1
expect animals Warthog 3
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Bear
kill Warthog
# Along the jetty to its head, the crate
walk -6 -42 to -6 -48 to -6 -54 h=1.5 below=4
open Crate on the jetty
# The woodcutter's cabin
walk -12.75 -17 to -12.75 -15 to -12.75 -12 h=4.1 below=5
expect stand -12.75 -12 h=4.1 below=5
open Woodcutter's box
# The bear's den on the north shore
walk 5 42 to 5 36 to 5 32 h=2.1 below=3
open Woodcutter's lost chest
dig
